      "content": "that makes sense. so if i were to turn those into actual survey questions, how would they look? like, how would a researcher ask about something like \"navigating authority\" or \"informal social networks\" in a way that catches those specific urban patterns? can u give me a few examples of multiple choice scenarios or questions that would help differentiate those behaviors?",
